          options: ['The level your zone has really reached in practice', 'The number of attacks the component stops per year', 'The level that follows from the risk assessment of the whole zone', 'What the component can deliver if it is set up correctly'],
          answer: 'What the component can deliver if it is set up correctly',
          why: 'Capability is what the product can do. What your zone reaches (SL-A) also depends on settings and the rest of the zone.',
